{"title":"Career Roadmap: Technical Programme Manager","role":"Technical Programme Manager","summary":"A Technical Programme Manager (TPM) leads complex technical programmes involving multiple engineering teams, products, systems, vendors, and business stakeholders.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Systems Engineering"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Technical Programme Manager (TPM) leads complex technical programmes involving multiple engineering teams, products, systems, vendors, and business stakeholders."},{"type":"p","text":"Unlike a traditional project manager, a TPM must understand the technical architecture, engineering dependencies, risks, delivery constraints, and business objectives well enough to coordinate technical decisions."},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Systems Engineering","Technical Depth","Programme Management","Product Thinking","Data-Driven Execution"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Programme planning and execution"},{"text":"Cross-functional engineering coordination"},{"text":"Technical dependency management"},{"text":"Architecture and system-level understanding"},{"text":"Risk and issue management"},{"text":"Resource and milestone planning"},{"text":"Engineering stakeholder management"},{"text":"Vendor coordination"},{"text":"Technical documentation"},{"text":"Executive reporting"},{"text":"Product and technology strategy"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Systems Engineer / Software Engineer / Technical Project Coordinator"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Technical Project Manager / Technical Program Manager"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Senior Technical Program Manager / Programme Lead"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Principal TPM / Group TPM / Programme Director / Technology Leader"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"A student should generally not expect to enter directly as a Technical Programme Manager after B.Tech. Engineering or technical delivery experience is normally the stronger route into TPM."}]},{"heading":"What to Build During the Degree","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Engineering Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engineering mathematics"},{"text":"Programming fundamentals"},{"text":"Data structures"},{"text":"Computer fundamentals"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Technical writing"},{"text":"Problem solving"},{"text":"Excel"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also understand how engineering teams build products."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Technical Depth"},{"type":"p","text":"Because TPM is a technical leadership role, develop strong fundamentals in at least one technical domain."},{"type":"p","text":"Possible domains:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Software engineering"},{"text":"Cloud computing"},{"text":"AI/ML"},{"text":"Embedded systems"},{"text":"Electronics"},{"text":"Cybersecurity"},{"text":"Networking"},{"text":"Data engineering"},{"text":"Systems engineering"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Git/GitHub"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"Linux"},{"text":"Software development lifecycle"},{"text":"System architecture"},{"text":"Testing"},{"text":"CI/CD fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Systems & Programme Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Systems engineering"},{"text":"Requirements engineering"},{"text":"System architecture"},{"text":"Interface management"},{"text":"Technical documentation"},{"text":"Agile/Scrum"},{"text":"Kanban"},{"text":"Risk management"},{"text":"Dependency management"},{"text":"Stakeholder management"},{"text":"Project estimation"},{"text":"Resource planning"}]},{"ty